        "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
      },
      "text": ", Monday: Caracas"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:5a4836cca1208c95",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "5d137a846c52924631f816e83c5f019cef491c6e1badcf83d3c2bc9d1c76a000",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261109-mw9la9dr-5gsd40eg",
        "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
      },
      "text": "Arrive in Caracas, where an English-speaking guide will meet you for the transfer to your hotel. After checking in and taking a short break, set out on a sightseeing tour of the capital. We can tailor the programme to your interests. Lunch at a traditional restaurant is at your own expense. Return to the hotel for an overnight stay in Caracas."
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_label:6a6a6905889e4c6b",
      "field": "itinerary.label",
      "sourceTextSha256": "ee5400eec5b34c56e85dcc8a4d8fd2467e9f49c08efa6bb1ec973ff8a04631fb",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261109-mw9la9dr-5gsd40eg",
        "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
      },
      "text": "Caracas"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:media_alt:c699cf1e27775800",
      "field": "media.alt",
      "sourceTextSha256": "feb171ce9d873349a05067e84c97000792a2129b55eaaad485c63a3e3d5c97fe",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261109-mw9la9dr-5gsd40eg",
        "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
      },
      "text": "Caracas neighbourhoods at the foot of green mountain slopes, Venezuela"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:media_hover:9014eeb001f4d079",
      "field": "media.hover",
      "sourceTextSha256": "076ce1fd405acf0c300ab0312992c1f4b8de6ae76236fe12017c374fa70543e8",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261109-mw9la9dr-5gsd40eg",
        "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
      },
      "text": "Caracas: a view of high-rise buildings against the mountains"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_title:ca0a4d6daf445776",
      "field": "itinerary.title",
      "sourceTextSha256": "7eeab5a0bf00235af81f8e423631df10fafb1f0206d9fe32fc36feb96596dec5",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261109-mw9la9dr-5gsd40eg",
        "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
      },
      "text": ", Tuesday: Los Roques Archipelago"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:569e72e117968fcc",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "1e32beeacf97ec48b1914b9b272e2004903ea5b6467d6f555e3f474ce9282d23",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261109-mw9la9dr-5gsd40eg",
        "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
      },
      "text": "Transfer to the airport early for your flight to Los Roques. Hotel staff will meet you at the airport. Spend the day on Madrisquí or Francisquí with a sun lounger, time by the sea and a packed lunch with drinks.\n\nLos Roques is a 2,250 sq km Venezuelan national park. The archipelago is made up of more than 350 small Caribbean islands and is considered one of the country’s most important marine reserves. You’ll find clear water, green islands and white-sand beaches with calm waters close to shore.\n\nOptional activities include a trip to outlying islands such as Cayo de Agua, a visit to a sea turtle conservation station and a natural pool with starfish, or a boat trip to fish for barracuda.\n\nMeals: packed lunch and dinner."
    },
    {
